Package: miadi
Version: 0.3.0
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: miadi-config (>= 0.2.0), miadi-tide (>= 0.1.0)
Maintainer: Miadi <mia@jgwill.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/jgwill/miadi-orchestration-kit
Description: Miadi host platform
 Installs the parts of a Miadi host. Each part is its own package and joins
 as a dependency here: miadi-config, the host's MIADI_* settings, and
 miadi-tide, the review loop and the tide runtime.
